{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1523201-sanity-and-mental-damage-rules-for-trinity","id":1523201,"title":"Sanity and mental damage rules for Trinity","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-09-27T02:28:34-07:00","id":1523201,"title":"Sanity and mental damage rules for Trinity","content":"Hi!<br /> <br /> I was thinking on using the Trinity ruleset to adapt the more pulpish of the Cthulhu modules. The thing is: I am missing how to adapt the rules for mental health and sanity. <br /> <br /> Has somebody tried something similar, or do you have any idea on how could we do something like this?<br /> <br /> Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10622-sedda00","name":"Sedda00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10622_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-27T05:13:58-07:00","id":1523203,"title":"","content":"Hi. It\u2019s not all Sanity, but in my House Rules book I made some rules to Stress and Traumas that involve fear, instability and direct social aggression. May be useful.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325224/House-Rules--The-Basics\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/images/4261/325224.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325224/House-Rules--The-Basics\" target=\"_blank\"> House Rules - The Basics - Onyx Path Publishing | StoryPath Nexus | DriveThruRPG.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"